  "description": "Antaline is an elegant display serif that blends timeless sophistication with artistic charm. Featuring dramatic high-contrast strokes, graceful proportions, and refined decorative details, it is designed to make every headline stand out with confidence and style. Complete with beautifully crafted alternates, flowing swashes, and 500+ carefully crafted glyphs, Antaline gives you the creative freedom to build unique logos, expressive branding, and editorial compositions that feel both luxurious and memorable.\nPerfect for luxury branding, fashion, beauty, cafés, premium packaging, wedding stationery, and editorial design, Antaline adds a distinctive character to every project. Whether you’re creating a refined wordmark, an eye-catching social media graphic, or elegant product packaging, its versatile OpenType features, multilingual support, and extensive character set ensure every composition feels polished, sophisticated, and effortlessly stylish.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Antaline is an elegant display serif that blends timeless sophistication with artistic charm. Featuring dramatic high-contrast strokes, graceful proportions, and refined decorative details, it is designed to make every headline stand out with confidence and style. Complete with beautifully crafted alternates, flowing swashes, and 500+ carefully crafted glyphs, Antaline gives you the creative freedom to build unique logos, expressive branding, and editorial compositions that feel both luxurious and memorable.</p>\n<p>Perfect for luxury branding, fashion, beauty, cafés, premium packaging, wedding stationery, and editorial design, Antaline adds a distinctive character to every project. Whether you’re creating a refined wordmark, an eye-catching social media graphic, or elegant product packaging, its versatile OpenType features, multilingual support, and extensive character set ensure every composition feels polished, sophisticated, and effortlessly stylish.</p>",
